Z||000000||Philphine||10-18-2001||12:11 PM||||<BR>you know what i'm doing right now. well obviously typing this, but i'm laying on my back in bed waiting to go to work. i should have gone out for a run but each fall it gets cold (ok, no surprise there) and i quit. i hate running in the cold, or even a slight chill. it got up to 40deg. and i should have gone and been back in time to get ready and go to work. i just couldn't make myself do it. cold just sucks the joy out of running.<P>so if you see me input anything bettween 9 and 12 on a weekday and nearly anytime on the weekend, please browbeat me and ask if i've run and if not why.<P>it won't work, but you can help keep me feeling guilty about it.<P>------------------<BR>Phil T.<P>start where you are,<BR>use what you have,<BR>do what you can.||||reg||1
