Z||000004||Fformula88||10-18-2001||03:20 PM||||Ditch the ski thing and the seatless bike and get a real treadmill.  I got one parked in fron tof the TV and make do with it in the winter... usually watch hockey while I am on it.  Sports just seem to make the time go faster than watchin sit coms or some other garbage.  Regular treadmills really aren't too bad... and definately a lot better to use than all those gimmick machines.||||reg||1
